  "target_provenance": {
    "tiriac": "article paragraph reports one of nine inconsistent; Table S4 and Figure S6A contain assay and clinical linkage. Eight of nine remains a published qualitative concordance target, not a newly invented threshold rule."
  },
  "amendment_before_any_valid_response": "Initial max/plus calls and a diagnostic Flash call all returned HTTP400 Arrearage with the same credential. The formerly successful minimal competition-kit Flash probe now returns the same error. No valid benchmark response received; original strong max/weak plus design retained.",
  "pilot_amendment": "2026-10-02, after two valid crlm first steps and before any cohort result: (1) prompt states that get_rows returns plain lists of raw values (the weak model treated rows as the {ref,value} preview objects and crashed) and that each of the first two replies is scored alone, so it must set CONTRACT (the strong model spent its single pass printing the table); (2) the per-paper cumulative token cap rises from 300,000 to 1,000,000 because one strong call already used 22,260 tokens, so 300,000 would stop the 12-call design after about six calls; cost stays bounded by the shared CNY ceiling and the 12-call cap; (3) tool turns allow parallel tool calls, matching the 32-tool/12-call design. The two pre-amendment crlm first steps are archived in runs/agent_v2_pilot0 and excluded from all results.",
  "round2_change": "Round 2 changes the figure path: the agent can no longer write visual labels. record_visual_labels is replaced by read_figure, which sends the rendered figure or crop to the lane's own model in a fresh conversation that never sees the task, the target or the agent's notes (reader_prompt.txt); its transcription becomes vision/<image>/R<row>C<col> references. Round 1 showed why: the strong agent's two figure-based passes (tiriac, tan) each rested on misread labels whose errors cancelled to the published number, one of them filled from the paper's aggregate counts. Round 2 also runs on the Doubao model set because the Qwen account went into arrears during round 1; the two rounds are separate rulers and their pass rates are never subtracted or pooled. Cohort, targets, 12 model calls, 32 tool calls, 1,000,000 tokens per paper and the judge are unchanged.",
