      "change": "One change after round 2: the per-paper step budget doubles (24 model calls, 64 tool calls); the 1,000,000-token cap stays as the cost guard. Eleven of the twelve failed round-2 chains were still converging when call 12 ended them (reading figure crops, fixing a formula or binding). Round 3 continues every unfinished round-2 chain from its twelfth call; the model is never told the cap, so its first twelve calls are those of a 24-call run."
    },
    "round4": {
      "model_set": "doubao",
      "root": "runs/agent_v2_r4",
      "figure_labels": "independent reader for printed labels, deterministic pixel reader for colours",
      "limits": {
        "max_model_calls_per_paper": 24,
        "max_tool_calls_per_paper": 64
      },
      "lanes": [
        "strong"
      ],
      "papers": [
        "hu",
        "dai",
        "tiriac",
        "schuster",
        "steinberg"
      ],
      "carried": {
        "from": "round3",
        "papers": [
          "crlm",
          "rectal",
          "tan",
          "ewart",
          "wang"
        ]
      },
      "change": "One change after round 3: a read_grid tool. Three of the five failed round-3 strong chains failed on figure reading: three misread heat-map cells, one response grid transcribed with different colour words across crops, and bar ends at the 180-day line that the model reader could only estimate. read_grid samples the centre of every cell of a grid the agent defines and names the colour from the pixels; the agent cannot alter its labels, only map colour names to legend categories under the same judge. Round 4 reruns the three figure papers and the two negative controls from the first call on the strong lane with round-3 limits; the other five papers do not depend on figure colours and keep their round-3 strong results."
    },
    "round5": {
      "model_set": "doubao",
      "root": "runs/agent_v2_r5",
      "cohort": "external",
      "lanes": [
        "strong"
      ],
      "figure_labels": "independent reader for printed labels, deterministic pixel reader for colours",
      "limits": {
        "max_model_calls_per_paper": 24,
        "max_tool_calls_per_paper": 64
      },
      "change": "No change to the agent. Round 5 runs the round-4 strong lane (same model, prompts, tools, judge, 24 calls, 64 tools, 1,000,000 tokens) on the external cohort. The workspace builder now also reads Word supplements (tables with captions, paragraphs, embedded figures; legacy .doc converted), fetches .webp figures, and takes sources from the PMC Open Access dataset; read_grid accepts .webp."
    }
  },
